WEBVTT

00:43.163 --> 00:45.374
There you go!

00:45.374 --> 00:47.245
Catch it.

00:47.918 --> 00:49.459
Gosh.

00:49.459 --> 00:52.130
It's sunny,
so why is it thundering so ominously?

00:52.130 --> 00:53.076
Dad,

00:53.076 --> 00:55.050
my mood was just right.

00:55.050 --> 00:55.802
Oh, my bad.

00:55.802 --> 00:58.121
Even thunder can't mess with your vibe.

00:58.121 --> 01:00.639
Never mind. I'm done shooting.

01:00.639 --> 01:01.667
What's wrong?

01:01.667 --> 01:03.546
Where are you going?

01:24.208 --> 01:26.331
Hi there.

01:26.331 --> 01:30.294
I'm Lee Ui Yeong. We spoke on the phone.

01:31.753 --> 01:33.666
Excuse me?

01:39.011 --> 01:41.268
Sir?

01:41.268 --> 01:42.889
Sir?

01:42.889 --> 01:45.809
- What?
- Gosh!

01:45.809 --> 01:47.436
I'm really sorry about that!

01:47.436 --> 01:49.313
So sorry!

01:50.772 --> 01:53.525
My apologies!

01:56.361 --> 01:58.417
Wait, Tae Seop?

01:58.417 --> 02:00.943
How come you're here?

02:03.076 --> 02:04.744
Did you

02:04.744 --> 02:06.188
come all this way for me?

02:06.188 --> 02:07.968
What? Me?

02:07.968 --> 02:10.786
Oh, not at all. It's a work thing.

02:11.542 --> 02:13.448
Hold on, are you...

02:13.448 --> 02:15.401
Lee Eun Ho?

02:15.401 --> 02:16.506
I'm the CEO of HOME.

02:16.506 --> 02:18.348
Oh, I thought...

02:18.348 --> 02:20.488
So you're the CEO of...

02:20.488 --> 02:22.288
What?

02:27.017 --> 02:29.858
Dad, some lady's over at Uncle's tent.

02:29.858 --> 02:32.766
What are you talking about?

02:35.525 --> 02:38.708
[Episode 4]

02:47.328 --> 02:49.241
Thank you.

03:03.595 --> 03:07.474
So you both run the company together?

03:11.250 --> 03:13.875
What's your name?

03:13.875 --> 03:15.718
- Lee Sua.
- I see.

03:15.718 --> 03:18.498
She's my daughter. She's seven.

03:18.498 --> 03:22.699
You had no clue he ran HOME?

03:22.699 --> 03:23.419
No.

03:23.419 --> 03:26.153
I heard you two were set up once.

03:27.327 --> 03:28.953
A buddy and I started

03:28.953 --> 03:32.081
a space branding firm called HOME.

03:32.081 --> 03:33.876
A space brand...

03:33.876 --> 03:37.336
Sounds like you two have a great bond.

03:37.336 --> 03:38.704
Yeah.

03:39.339 --> 03:40.632
- You were aware the whole time.
- Yeah.

03:40.632 --> 03:43.250
Wait, you knew?

03:43.250 --> 03:47.597
A quick call or message would've been nice.

03:47.597 --> 03:49.617
We could've avoided this whole mess.

03:49.617 --> 03:52.352
I thought the job would reveal it on its own.

03:52.352 --> 03:54.416
Yet look where we ended up.

03:54.416 --> 03:56.250
Right...

03:56.250 --> 03:57.524
We kind of brought this on ourselves.

03:57.524 --> 04:02.334
Who told you we were camping here?

04:02.334 --> 04:03.655
Were you tracking us down?

04:03.655 --> 04:05.916
Nothing shady.

04:05.916 --> 04:07.667
All above board.

04:07.667 --> 04:09.529
Thank you.

04:10.291 --> 04:12.038
Excuse me. Hello.

04:12.038 --> 04:14.777
Any idea where in Chuncheon I can find the CEO?

04:14.777 --> 04:15.317
Sorry?

04:15.317 --> 04:18.044
There's something I must tell him.

04:18.044 --> 04:21.041
He's going to wish he heard me out.

04:23.125 --> 04:24.675
What I

04:24.675 --> 04:27.041
wanted to say is...

04:27.041 --> 04:29.300
I'm truly sorry.

04:29.300 --> 04:30.750
I've learned

04:30.750 --> 04:34.018
that overstepping starts with thinking

04:34.018 --> 04:35.381
"this much is fine."

04:35.381 --> 04:37.958
I also owe you another apology

04:37.958 --> 04:40.483
for the copied designs.

04:40.483 --> 04:43.361
The news said

04:43.361 --> 04:44.721
the hotel was unaware too.

04:44.721 --> 04:46.406
You're right, we were in the dark.

04:46.406 --> 04:49.213
Still, better due diligence on our end

04:49.213 --> 04:53.166
could've prevented it.

04:53.166 --> 04:56.375
I can't believe you showed up
just because I said to.

04:56.375 --> 04:57.792
How are you this cooperative?

04:57.792 --> 05:00.461
Now I feel like the villain.

05:00.461 --> 05:00.962
Not at all.

05:00.962 --> 05:03.798
To be fair,
Tae Seop carried most of the weight.

05:03.798 --> 05:05.375
Around the clock, really.

05:05.375 --> 05:08.958
Anyway...

05:08.958 --> 05:10.291
apology accepted.

05:10.291 --> 05:11.621
Thank you so much.

05:11.621 --> 05:13.641
Seriously, I appreciate it.

05:13.641 --> 05:15.321
Okay, time to say something.

05:15.321 --> 05:17.754
Tell them about the fresh pitch.

05:17.754 --> 05:20.500
Explain how this deal works out for all of us.

05:20.500 --> 05:23.547
Show them they can't lose.

05:23.547 --> 05:26.398
Those words should be coming out, but...

05:27.572 --> 05:29.783
Come on, just say it...

05:31.416 --> 05:33.488
Just open your mouth...

05:34.079 --> 05:35.622
My lips won't move.

05:35.622 --> 05:38.625
Anything else on your mind?

05:38.625 --> 05:40.495
Actually...

05:42.999 --> 05:44.589
I came with presents.

05:44.589 --> 05:47.050
I brought a few things from the hotel.

05:47.050 --> 05:49.761
Well, this seat seems to be for me?

05:49.761 --> 05:50.804
Here's some meat.

05:50.804 --> 05:52.750
And Sua,

05:52.750 --> 05:54.974
I brought chocolate for you.

05:54.974 --> 05:56.774
Looks tasty, huh?

05:58.228 --> 05:59.291
Right.

05:59.291 --> 06:00.755
Bringing up business

06:00.755 --> 06:03.367
right after saying sorry is tacky.

06:03.367 --> 06:06.916
Let me ease the tension first,
get them comfortable.

06:06.916 --> 06:09.030
Looks like we can skip the grocery run.

06:09.030 --> 06:11.307
And after that, I'll make my move.

06:11.307 --> 06:14.529
Since you traveled so far, eat with us.

06:15.336 --> 06:17.657
Can I lend a hand at all?

06:17.657 --> 06:20.037
Oh, please relax.

06:20.037 --> 06:21.626
I'd never ask a guest to do chores.

06:21.626 --> 06:23.208
All right.

06:23.208 --> 06:27.042
So what are you going to do?

06:28.916 --> 06:31.129
You were waiting for her to reach out.

06:33.661 --> 06:36.937
Head down by the river and get some air.

06:36.937 --> 06:38.702
Let me take care of this.

06:46.302 --> 06:48.802
Everything's handled on this end.

06:48.802 --> 06:50.857
You've got this.

06:55.076 --> 06:56.782
Hyun Min.

06:56.782 --> 06:57.999
Yeah?

06:57.999 --> 07:01.702
Getting a permanent spot seems unlikely, huh?

07:01.702 --> 07:03.750
Well...

07:03.750 --> 07:07.582
Nobody can predict that yet.

07:07.582 --> 07:09.523
How about food and some soju?

07:09.523 --> 07:11.382
Not tonight. Let's do it another day.

07:11.382 --> 07:12.948
Sae Byeok,

07:12.948 --> 07:15.263
treat yourself this weekend.

07:15.263 --> 07:18.183
Find something entertaining to watch,
and stop worrying so much.

07:18.183 --> 07:21.763
The future's a mystery for everyone,

07:21.763 --> 07:22.812
right?

07:22.812 --> 07:25.058
- All right.
- Things will fall into place.

07:39.829 --> 07:41.078
Sua,

07:41.078 --> 07:42.290
I'll be your camerawoman.

07:42.290 --> 07:44.416
No thanks.

07:44.416 --> 07:45.819
You didn't even check.

07:45.819 --> 07:47.639
I'm so good.

07:47.639 --> 07:48.499
What vibe?

07:48.499 --> 07:50.319
Vertical? Face cam?

07:50.319 --> 07:53.625
Or like a performance video style?

07:53.625 --> 07:55.595
Okay, you know what you're doing.

07:55.595 --> 07:58.800
Make me look taller.

07:59.473 --> 08:02.769
If it comes out good,
you owe me some hangout time.

08:02.769 --> 08:05.196
- Okay.
- Okay.

08:07.398 --> 08:09.227
Make you look tall?

08:10.559 --> 08:13.041
Oh, you look so much taller.

08:13.041 --> 08:14.983
Not perfect yet.

08:15.625 --> 08:17.425
Give me a sec.

08:22.872 --> 08:24.672
Sua, come here real quick.

08:27.333 --> 08:29.459
Perfect! Have a look.

08:29.459 --> 08:31.464
So cute.

08:31.464 --> 08:33.133
Are you happy with it?

08:33.916 --> 08:36.880
So pretty. The weather makes it even better.

08:38.239 --> 08:40.140
Sua, turn this way and look here.

08:40.140 --> 08:41.850
That's it.

08:42.542 --> 08:44.342
Great.

08:45.875 --> 08:47.864
Sua, move to the flower side, right here.

08:47.864 --> 08:49.042
Perfect.

08:49.042 --> 08:50.884
Good, come closer.

08:50.884 --> 08:52.684
Yeah.

08:53.697 --> 08:54.704
Hold it right there.

08:54.704 --> 08:56.103
Perfect.

08:56.103 --> 08:57.203
Here, have a look.

08:57.203 --> 08:58.825
Check it out. What do you think?

08:58.825 --> 08:59.963
I love it.

08:59.963 --> 09:01.999
Nailed it, right?

09:01.999 --> 09:03.064
It's Uncle!

09:03.064 --> 09:04.950
Hey, Uncle!

09:20.554 --> 09:21.765
[Too bad, no new chats yet...]

09:21.765 --> 09:23.983
[28 people favorited me!]

09:26.916 --> 09:29.250
I look this attractive

09:29.250 --> 09:31.768
and not one date lined up.

09:34.250 --> 09:36.773
I don't want to swipe anymore.

09:38.868 --> 09:40.902
I'll just read comics.

09:45.625 --> 09:47.450
Soonmu.

09:52.923 --> 09:54.922
I'm interested in the comics you posted.

09:54.922 --> 09:58.125
They're not too outdated to read now, right?

09:58.125 --> 10:00.124
Alright, the time has come to send you off.

10:00.124 --> 10:04.303
I'll take good care so the value stays up.

10:04.303 --> 10:05.558
Outdated?

10:05.558 --> 10:06.684
These are classics.

10:06.684 --> 10:10.181
Timeless masterpieces.

10:12.482 --> 10:15.659
Are there plenty of attractive guys in it?

10:15.659 --> 10:16.694
For sure,

10:16.694 --> 10:18.982
the illustrations are unreal.

10:21.745 --> 10:22.945
Oh, nice.

10:22.945 --> 10:25.026
I can't wait to start reading.
Can we meet today?

10:25.026 --> 10:27.265
Let me see the condition first,
then I'll take it.

10:27.265 --> 10:28.456
Today?

10:28.456 --> 10:29.250
[Ready to move forward with this buyer?]

10:29.250 --> 10:32.162
[Reserved]
Bet she'll love this one.

10:34.503 --> 10:36.303
Okay.

10:39.175 --> 10:41.427
What's your go-to malatang order?

10:41.427 --> 10:43.826
Glass noodles and fried tofu for me.

10:43.826 --> 10:44.686
You?

10:44.686 --> 10:47.559
Snow fungus and dried tofu skin for me.

10:47.559 --> 10:48.266
Oh yeah?

10:48.266 --> 10:49.834
Hold on, Sua.

10:49.834 --> 10:52.814
Did you call her "unnie"?

10:52.814 --> 10:54.394
You never warm up to strangers this fast.

10:54.394 --> 10:56.227
That's not true!

10:57.834 --> 11:00.713
Tae Seop, are you getting dinner ready?

11:00.713 --> 11:02.313
That's right.

11:02.313 --> 11:04.152
Sua, here...

11:04.958 --> 11:06.905
Over here.

11:11.208 --> 11:13.244
I can carry it.

11:28.486 --> 11:32.138
How did he know my shoes were wet?

11:45.516 --> 11:49.046
That's my girl, Sua.

11:51.708 --> 11:53.966
This is super fresh!

11:53.966 --> 11:58.790
Look at Sua, all grown up now, huh?

12:11.142 --> 12:12.227
You alright?

12:12.227 --> 12:13.834
Gosh...

12:13.834 --> 12:16.224
- Hand it over. I got it.
- Yeah.

12:18.208 --> 12:21.333
Sorry, I just wanted to pitch in.

12:21.333 --> 12:24.306
I get it, but just go have a seat.

12:24.306 --> 12:25.507
You're too close to the flame. Not safe.

12:25.507 --> 12:28.626
Yeah, come here.

12:37.834 --> 12:39.667
Get me some juice, please.

12:39.667 --> 12:40.667
Do I look like your waiter?

12:40.667 --> 12:42.721
Thanks.

12:42.721 --> 12:44.676
One more, please.

12:44.676 --> 12:46.880
- Ask nicely.
- Please.

12:54.418 --> 12:57.849
Unnie, your face is super red right now.

12:58.542 --> 13:00.752
You look like a baked sweet potato.

13:00.752 --> 13:02.771
Oh, really?

13:07.198 --> 13:09.027
It's just so warm in here.

13:15.220 --> 13:17.577
Meat's ready.

13:19.043 --> 13:22.047
- Help yourselves.
- Thank you, I'll enjoy it.

13:22.880 --> 13:23.927
Good?

13:23.927 --> 13:26.044
We should scrap the interior design business.

13:27.875 --> 13:31.267
This is incredible. It's so tender.

13:31.267 --> 13:33.667
There's a ton of meat left.

13:33.667 --> 13:35.947
Just have some with us for now.

13:35.947 --> 13:37.999
Yeah, grab a bite too.

13:37.999 --> 13:39.068
Here, Sua, say "ah."

13:39.068 --> 13:40.448
I'm fine. I don't want any.

13:40.448 --> 13:42.027
My stomach's not empty.

13:42.027 --> 13:44.048
What? Don't come crying when it's all gone.

13:44.048 --> 13:45.851
I'm going to eat it all.

13:45.851 --> 13:48.005
- Huh?
- What?

13:52.458 --> 13:54.746
I think she'll want food later tonight.

13:54.746 --> 13:57.283
She snacked too much during the day.

13:58.792 --> 14:00.874
What animal does Sua like?

14:00.874 --> 14:02.774
A rabbit, a bear, or a swan?

14:02.774 --> 14:03.993
She loves them all, honestly.

14:03.993 --> 14:06.554
- Rabbits?
- Rabbits, huh?

15:05.483 --> 15:08.470
Suite guest Ms. Sua,

15:08.470 --> 15:09.890
your room service is here.

15:09.890 --> 15:14.193
Here are some mini burgers just for you.

15:26.337 --> 15:28.666
Enjoy your meal.

15:36.125 --> 15:38.506
Soonmu.

15:38.506 --> 15:39.587
I'm here.

15:39.587 --> 15:41.638
I'm in the red hoodie.

16:01.080 --> 16:02.667
You're JoongKkeokMa, right?

16:02.667 --> 16:04.458
Actually,

16:04.458 --> 16:05.687
it's JoongKkakMa,

16:05.687 --> 16:09.963
like "what matters is unshakable spirit."

16:09.963 --> 16:11.333
- What?
- Well...

16:11.333 --> 16:12.495
So you're HeungCheongMangCheong?

16:12.495 --> 16:14.583
My username is HeungJeongMangJeong.

16:14.583 --> 16:16.464
I see...

16:22.834 --> 16:27.375
If there's even a booger smudge on these,
the deal's off.

16:27.375 --> 16:29.708
I'm not that kind of person, okay?

16:29.708 --> 16:31.083
Oh, please.

16:31.083 --> 16:33.982
Everyone picks their nose.

16:38.284 --> 16:41.830
Hey, we're not at a manga cafe here.

16:42.958 --> 16:45.201
I zone in fast, that's all.

16:45.201 --> 16:47.222
Don't make it weird.

16:47.222 --> 16:48.460
So...

16:48.460 --> 16:52.041
skip these two worn ones
and knock off ten thousand won.

16:53.674 --> 16:56.052
No, this is a set. That doesn't work.

16:56.052 --> 16:59.658
Plus, this scene right here...

16:59.658 --> 17:03.881
You can't say you've read it
without seeing this part.

17:03.881 --> 17:05.942
Well, that's the reader's call.

17:05.942 --> 17:08.331
I'm buying this

17:08.331 --> 17:09.773
for this guy.

17:09.773 --> 17:12.812
I want to see this guy play basketball.

17:14.291 --> 17:16.092
Otherwise, at least cut me a deal.

17:16.092 --> 17:17.831
It says right in the listing.

17:17.831 --> 17:20.028
No haggling.

17:30.086 --> 17:32.750
My eyes hurt.

17:32.750 --> 17:35.049
All right then, how about we let a game decide?

17:35.049 --> 17:36.342
A game?

17:36.342 --> 17:37.510
So you don't actually plan to buy.

17:37.510 --> 17:39.428
- Hold on.
- You keep changing the subject...

17:39.428 --> 17:41.472
We're here over a basketball manga,
so why not play for it?

17:41.472 --> 17:44.166
I win, you drop ten thousand won.

17:44.166 --> 17:47.208
You win, I'll pay ten thousand more.

17:47.208 --> 17:49.008
Ten thousand won?

17:52.333 --> 17:56.135
You're challenging me to one-on-one?

17:56.135 --> 17:59.047
One on... what?

17:59.047 --> 18:01.993
No confidence in that?
Fine, we can rock-paper-scissors instead.

18:01.993 --> 18:04.538
Yeah, you're definitely scared.

18:07.166 --> 18:10.406
There's no way I lose in basketball.

18:10.406 --> 18:12.645
Okay, I'm ready.

18:12.645 --> 18:14.422
You sure you won't regret this?

18:14.422 --> 18:16.258
Deal.

18:18.667 --> 18:21.304
Hold on, this is an arcade game!

18:21.304 --> 18:22.542
What?

18:22.542 --> 18:24.125
Look at this.

18:24.125 --> 18:26.309
It's literally a basketball game.

18:26.309 --> 18:28.638
Any five-year-old could tell you.

18:29.916 --> 18:33.024
Fork over one thousand won to play.

18:33.024 --> 18:34.824
Come on, hurry.

18:38.291 --> 18:40.091
Okay.

18:42.241 --> 18:44.792
Let me show you how it's done.

18:44.792 --> 18:47.573
I'll go real easy on you.

19:11.270 --> 19:14.667
[Target Score, 20] [Your Score, 39]

19:14.667 --> 19:16.910
How is that all going in...

19:17.568 --> 19:18.986
[Time over]

19:18.986 --> 19:19.529
[Bonus points earned]

19:19.529 --> 19:21.792
Yes!

19:21.792 --> 19:25.125
You see that score? 145.

19:28.580 --> 19:30.206
Now you're up.

19:30.206 --> 19:32.251
Go ahead now.

19:37.797 --> 19:39.632
For someone who wasn't interested...

19:39.632 --> 19:40.550
Okay.

19:40.550 --> 19:42.848
My left hand only guides the ball.

19:47.875 --> 19:50.500
He's not bad.

19:50.500 --> 19:53.723
Seriously, knock it off!

19:54.333 --> 19:56.208
You're playing so dirty right now.

19:56.208 --> 19:57.583
What's dirty about it?

19:57.583 --> 20:00.730
I never said blocking was a foul.

20:01.654 --> 20:02.785
Okay.

20:02.785 --> 20:05.240
Then body contact's fair game too, right?

20:05.240 --> 20:07.040
[Three points]

20:07.910 --> 20:10.622
I need to focus.

20:27.096 --> 20:29.239
[GRADE, C, ACCURACY, 65%]
[TOTAL SCORE, 129]

20:32.810 --> 20:35.250
All right, let's make it best of three.

20:35.250 --> 20:36.605
Let's play a different game.

20:36.605 --> 20:39.542
What else is there?

20:39.542 --> 20:40.692
Bring it on.

20:40.692 --> 20:42.875
Get over here.

20:42.875 --> 20:45.113
Stop getting in my way like that.

20:45.113 --> 20:48.167
What? Look, right over there!

20:54.957 --> 20:56.960
You're finished!

21:03.750 --> 21:05.766
Okay.

21:08.999 --> 21:10.897
Drift.

21:12.183 --> 21:14.233
Come on.

21:16.520 --> 21:18.522
Did you catch my ultimate technique?

21:18.522 --> 21:21.652
- Don't talk to me informally.
- Okay.

21:32.912 --> 21:35.250
We are merely small specks

21:35.250 --> 21:38.883
in this infinite cosmos.

21:42.754 --> 21:43.792
Sua,

21:43.792 --> 21:46.789
I'm going to let you have a marshmallow today.

21:46.789 --> 21:48.500
- For real?
- Let's go.

21:48.500 --> 21:50.102
Let's go.

22:06.833 --> 22:09.125
- Do you feel uncomfortable?
- What?

22:09.125 --> 22:12.124
No, it is not awkward.

22:14.083 --> 22:15.994
- Did you see the shooting star?
- What?

22:15.994 --> 22:17.333
Hurry up and make a wish.

22:17.333 --> 22:19.458
I hope my mom, Seung Jun, Dad,

22:19.458 --> 22:22.334
Sua, Tae Seop, Eun Ho, and I
are all healthy and happy,

22:22.334 --> 22:23.795
and please let my salary increase,

22:23.795 --> 22:26.757
and since I've not given up on dating,
please look after me.

22:26.757 --> 22:29.969
Why do you have such a lengthy wish?

22:29.969 --> 22:33.472
I don't often get the opportunity
to make a wish.

22:33.472 --> 22:36.524
Did you wish for anything?

22:38.166 --> 22:40.018
Well, didn't you wish to get married?

22:40.018 --> 22:41.875
What?

22:41.875 --> 22:43.250
No. Why...

22:43.250 --> 22:45.837
You brought that up

22:45.837 --> 22:47.797
at our first meeting,

22:47.797 --> 22:50.413
and I was quite shocked.

22:51.297 --> 22:52.958
I'm...

22:52.958 --> 22:56.125
at an age for serious dating,

22:56.125 --> 22:57.291
and...

22:57.291 --> 23:01.674
I spoke too forcefully
while trying to say I'm interested in you.

23:05.547 --> 23:08.275
So that's what you meant?

23:08.275 --> 23:09.916
So,

23:09.916 --> 23:11.995
did you go on another date

23:11.995 --> 23:14.596
because I caught you off guard about marriage?

23:14.596 --> 23:16.750
Well, it did catch me by surprise.

23:16.750 --> 23:20.352
But you told me to go for it so coolly,

23:20.352 --> 23:24.196
so I figured you just weren't into me.

23:25.375 --> 23:27.950
I did, didn't I?

23:29.529 --> 23:31.555
It's strange, isn't it?

23:31.555 --> 23:36.167
Being considerate only drove us further apart.

23:36.979 --> 23:39.629
The more I try to ignore you,

23:40.583 --> 23:42.733
the more I can't help but notice you.

23:44.958 --> 23:48.250
I tried to keep it professional today, but...

23:48.250 --> 23:49.889
honestly,

23:52.158 --> 23:55.436
you're still all I can think about.

24:10.737 --> 24:13.291
Look, this is really good.

24:13.291 --> 24:14.906
Oh, thanks.

24:14.906 --> 24:16.777
Okay.

24:16.777 --> 24:18.076
Here.

24:18.076 --> 24:19.920
Give it to me.

24:29.798 --> 24:32.083
I know what he means

24:32.083 --> 24:35.553
about noticing someone

24:35.553 --> 24:37.687
the harder he tries to stop.

24:55.414 --> 24:58.542
Even though I've messed everything up,

24:58.542 --> 25:01.043
I find myself getting my hopes up again.

25:12.005 --> 25:14.092
Sua fell asleep.

25:17.999 --> 25:19.583
Oh, watch your step.

25:19.583 --> 25:21.772
I forgot about this one.

25:23.106 --> 25:26.446
I'll wash this quickly. Put Sua to bed.

25:26.446 --> 25:29.739
I'd appreciate that. Thanks.

25:42.328 --> 25:44.126
Hey.

25:44.126 --> 25:46.665
If she is okay with it,
let's ask her to sleep over.

25:46.665 --> 25:48.416
You and I can share a tent,

25:48.416 --> 25:50.916
and she can sleep with Sua.

25:50.916 --> 25:54.305
It's way too dark out here in the mountains.

25:55.667 --> 25:58.392
Yeah, I gotta tidy up the tent.

26:16.236 --> 26:18.579
[Dad, Uncle]

26:21.951 --> 26:25.103
[Whiskey Brand Pop-up Proposal]

26:35.588 --> 26:37.593
[Team Manager Oh Myeong Un]

26:37.593 --> 26:39.914
I totally forgot.

26:39.914 --> 26:42.645
Or was I just avoiding it?

26:45.333 --> 26:46.774
It's me.

26:46.774 --> 26:48.574
Did he agree to work with us?

26:48.574 --> 26:52.041
Well, I'm keeping an eye on things.

26:52.041 --> 26:55.291
I think we should wait until we're in Seoul

26:55.291 --> 26:57.231
to officially sit down

26:57.231 --> 26:59.112
and pitch the proposal...

26:59.112 --> 27:02.774
I mean, who takes a cab all the way
out to Chuncheon just to apologize?

27:02.774 --> 27:05.829
Since you're already there,
act like you own the place.

27:05.829 --> 27:07.667
Don't look pathetic, okay?

27:07.667 --> 27:08.374
Pathetic?

27:08.374 --> 27:12.813
If they say no, we just walk away. Simple.

27:12.813 --> 27:13.734
Got it?

27:13.734 --> 27:15.613
Hello?

27:15.613 --> 27:17.298
Is the signal bad?

27:17.298 --> 27:20.766
No, I hear you loud and clear.

27:22.083 --> 27:24.393
I'll talk to him.

27:24.393 --> 27:27.356
That's why I'm staying up so late for this.

27:30.968 --> 27:32.642
Okay.

27:41.667 --> 27:43.168
Nina,

27:43.168 --> 27:45.702
I cursed and resented you.

27:45.702 --> 27:48.828
I tore up your letters and photographs.

27:48.828 --> 27:50.958
But I never forgot

27:50.958 --> 27:53.349
that my soul is tied

27:53.349 --> 27:55.843
to yours for eternity.

27:59.328 --> 28:02.308
I can't bring myself to hate you, Nina.

28:09.416 --> 28:10.852
Great work out there today.

28:10.852 --> 28:12.029
You all did great.

28:12.029 --> 28:13.184
Great job, everyone.

28:13.184 --> 28:16.238
- Let's wrap up and go grab a drink.
- Sounds good.

28:24.190 --> 28:25.198
For the wrap party.

28:25.198 --> 28:28.201
Yeah, our usual BBQ spot by the park.

28:28.201 --> 28:31.016
Actually, want to make it just us two?

28:31.016 --> 28:34.632
I'd love to get to know you better.

28:41.916 --> 28:46.469
If you ignore how people feel...
Do you think you can be a good actor?

28:46.469 --> 28:49.428
Hey, Eun A is quitting after tonight.

28:49.428 --> 28:50.157
Just letting you all know.

28:50.157 --> 28:53.335
A new hire finally joined and is leaving?

28:53.335 --> 28:54.935
It's obvious.

28:54.935 --> 28:56.896
Boy-girl drama.

28:56.896 --> 28:59.566
She hung out with Shin Ji Su for a while.

28:59.566 --> 29:03.236
I mean, he's not even acting.
He's actually trying to seduce people.

29:03.236 --> 29:07.095
Actors, the audience, everyone.

29:07.095 --> 29:09.216
She's my scene partner.
I was just looking out for her.

29:09.216 --> 29:10.415
You hear that?

29:10.415 --> 29:12.458
Sounds like a compliment, not a diss.

29:12.458 --> 29:13.913
Look, my point is...

29:13.913 --> 29:16.047
Seriously though, stop stirring things up here

29:16.047 --> 29:17.855
and just go do movies or dramas.

29:17.855 --> 29:18.316
For real.

29:18.316 --> 29:21.714
You've got directors lining up to cast you.

29:21.714 --> 29:22.884
Drop it.

29:22.884 --> 29:25.641
Life's exhausting enough as it is.

29:28.887 --> 29:30.375
You guys killed the vibe.

29:30.375 --> 29:31.445
I'm leaving.

29:31.445 --> 29:33.875
Hey, if you leave,
who's going to grill the meat?

29:33.875 --> 29:35.084
You hungry?

29:35.084 --> 29:38.479
You guys have been roasting me
so hard I figured you were full.

29:38.479 --> 29:40.544
- Where should I...
- I'll take that.

29:41.542 --> 29:43.588
Grill your own damn meat, all right?

29:44.665 --> 29:46.624
And don't come looking for me.

29:46.624 --> 29:48.384
You have nowhere else to go.

29:48.384 --> 29:49.505
The theater's basically your home.

29:49.505 --> 29:51.132
You're seriously leaving?

29:51.132 --> 29:53.752
Didn't you just get fired
from your part-time job?

30:31.658 --> 30:33.577
You've been standing here a while.

30:33.577 --> 30:35.880
Is there anything I can help you with?

30:35.880 --> 30:38.700
No, I'm good.

30:38.700 --> 30:40.799
Here, take this.

30:42.667 --> 30:45.012
It smells really nice.

30:45.999 --> 30:47.765
Take care.

31:01.563 --> 31:02.813
[airy] [Part-time help wanted]

31:02.813 --> 31:05.038
[Duties,
Drinks, customer service, cleaning, etc.]

31:09.739 --> 31:13.282
So there's this movie
Director Jin's working on in secret.

31:13.282 --> 31:14.992
[Dokgo]
The female lead is a gardener

31:14.992 --> 31:16.285
who's slowly losing her sight.

31:16.285 --> 31:19.208
She's waiting for an old love
who may never come back,

31:19.208 --> 31:22.683
tending a garden full of poisonous plants.

31:23.710 --> 31:25.964
It's a thriller-romance.

31:25.964 --> 31:27.750
So?

31:27.750 --> 31:30.451
Is Director Jin going to cast me?

31:30.451 --> 31:32.152
I heard my scandal's got him on the fence.

31:32.152 --> 31:33.392
Oh, come on.

31:33.392 --> 31:35.151
Since when do tabloid rumors matter?

31:35.151 --> 31:36.891
Nothing official even came out.

31:36.891 --> 31:38.392
We've got a meeting set up.

31:38.392 --> 31:40.268
So just relax at a hotel for a few days,

31:40.268 --> 31:42.711
recharge, and then we'll reconnect.

31:42.711 --> 31:45.447
We've got to get back to Cannes.

31:49.110 --> 31:51.286
Pull over for a sec.

31:53.374 --> 31:55.082
Ji Su!

31:57.166 --> 31:59.215
You got even more handsome
since I last saw you.

31:59.215 --> 32:00.934
Why aren't you picking up my calls?

32:00.934 --> 32:03.632
Aren't we close enough to talk on the phone?

32:04.454 --> 32:06.510
Need some spending money?

32:09.350 --> 32:10.375
What?

32:10.375 --> 32:13.495
An adult is talking.
Who does he take after with that attitude...

32:13.495 --> 32:16.354
Want to pop in for a bit?

32:16.354 --> 32:18.074
Forget it.

32:18.074 --> 32:20.399
He can't avoid me forever.

32:21.311 --> 32:23.569
I'm tired. Let's go.

32:26.770 --> 32:29.950
So you're just sending her away?

32:35.500 --> 32:37.249
Look, Ui Yeong...

32:39.208 --> 32:40.391
Well...

32:40.391 --> 32:44.710
it's getting really late
and the last train's about to stop running.

32:44.710 --> 32:47.351
Hey, can you give her a ride to the station?

32:47.351 --> 32:49.590
I can't drive. I had a beer.

32:49.590 --> 32:51.172
What?

32:53.708 --> 32:57.364
Tae Seop, why are you suddenly...

32:57.364 --> 32:59.984
Why did you come here?

32:59.984 --> 33:01.518
Sorry?

33:01.518 --> 33:05.777
Why did you stick around,
hanging out with us, being so nice?

33:08.041 --> 33:09.907
Oh, well, I...

33:13.625 --> 33:16.244
You didn't come here to apologize.

33:16.244 --> 33:18.044
Just say it.

33:18.044 --> 33:20.375
I'll hear you out. One last time.

33:22.500 --> 33:24.296
Well, the thing is...

33:25.141 --> 33:29.801
I was going to start with an apology,

33:30.866 --> 33:33.847
and then, this proposal...

33:35.125 --> 33:36.916
I reworked it

33:36.916 --> 33:40.363
in a way that benefits both sides.

33:40.363 --> 33:41.514
I mean, obviously,

33:41.514 --> 33:45.518
you already have a solid customer base,

33:45.518 --> 33:49.567
but if you partner with our hotel,

33:49.567 --> 33:51.943
it could really help

33:51.943 --> 33:55.827
get the brand out there...

33:57.029 --> 33:58.625
Are you done?

33:58.625 --> 34:00.582
Want me to call you a cab?

34:03.161 --> 34:04.878
No.

34:06.500 --> 34:09.007
I'll go on my own.

34:10.834 --> 34:13.095
Sorry for the trouble.

34:50.166 --> 34:52.708
How are you so good at every game?

34:52.708 --> 34:54.259
Did you just eat and play games all day?

34:54.259 --> 34:56.800
I'm good at winning.

34:56.800 --> 34:58.338
I'm in a good mood.

34:58.338 --> 35:01.238
I made some cash, so here's a free tip.

35:01.238 --> 35:03.990
I'm the one who made the money here.

35:03.990 --> 35:04.991
What's the tip?

35:04.991 --> 35:07.517
If you only play it straight like you do,

35:07.517 --> 35:09.491
you'll never beat someone like me.

35:09.491 --> 35:11.191
When you meet your match, just run. Okay?

35:11.191 --> 35:14.656
What kind of tip is that?

35:17.166 --> 35:20.829
Anyway, let's never see each other again.

35:21.573 --> 35:23.660
Wait...

35:25.870 --> 35:26.913
You...

35:26.913 --> 35:28.746
seem a bit bummed.

35:28.746 --> 35:31.089
How about one more deal with me?

35:32.188 --> 35:33.207
What kind of...

35:33.207 --> 35:35.208
This thing is so heavy.

35:35.208 --> 35:37.987
Carry it to my place
and I'll give you ten thousand won.

35:37.987 --> 35:40.182
Think of it as a delivery fee.

35:59.250 --> 36:03.114
Yeah, this is pretty heavy, actually.

36:03.114 --> 36:05.577
You better keep that promise.

36:11.458 --> 36:13.340
Yeah. Here.

36:22.083 --> 36:24.184
You knew I was hitting on you, right?

36:24.184 --> 36:26.792
You were being so obvious about it,

36:26.792 --> 36:28.641
I kind of had a feeling.

36:28.641 --> 36:30.137
And

36:30.137 --> 36:34.027
you still didn't run and came right along?

37:34.166 --> 37:36.089
Are you done?

37:36.836 --> 37:38.341
Done.

38:36.267 --> 38:38.985
[23:30 (Last Bus)]

38:40.686 --> 38:42.206
What?

38:42.206 --> 38:44.783
That was the last bus?

39:11.458 --> 39:14.813
Seriously, nothing is going my way today.

39:22.480 --> 39:24.526
Gosh.

39:26.109 --> 39:27.485
Sua, turn this way and look here.

39:27.485 --> 39:28.402
It's uncle!

39:28.402 --> 39:30.161
Uncle!

39:31.281 --> 39:32.949
- Did you see the shooting star?
- What?

39:32.949 --> 39:35.412
Hurry up and make a wish.

39:37.542 --> 39:39.754
Sorry for the trouble.

39:53.636 --> 39:55.723
[Ui Yeong]

39:55.723 --> 39:57.729
The person you are trying to reach
is unavailable.

39:57.729 --> 40:01.034
Please leave a message after the beep.

40:01.034 --> 40:03.133
Tae Seop!

40:03.133 --> 40:04.529
Song Tae Seop!

40:06.274 --> 40:07.867
It's pouring out here!

40:07.867 --> 40:09.634
It's like the sky split open!

40:09.634 --> 40:10.814
Oh crap, this is bad.

40:10.814 --> 40:12.154
We need to go, now.

40:12.154 --> 40:14.334
This tent can barely handle a drizzle.

40:14.334 --> 40:17.614
Pack everything up
and get to town with Sua ahead of me.

40:17.614 --> 40:18.514
What about you?

40:18.514 --> 40:20.333
I can't reach Ui Yeong.

40:20.333 --> 40:22.667
I need to make sure she got home safe.

40:22.667 --> 40:25.500
She's not answering.
How are you going to check?

40:25.500 --> 40:26.291
- I don't know.
- What?

40:26.291 --> 40:28.013
- I'll call you later.
- Hey.

40:28.013 --> 40:29.913
Song Tae Seop!

40:29.913 --> 40:31.556
Hey!

40:44.728 --> 40:46.863
It's so cold.

40:56.032 --> 40:58.704
I guess karma's finally catching up to me.

41:01.583 --> 41:04.083
Ui Yeong!

41:04.083 --> 41:06.419
Ui Yeong!

41:06.419 --> 41:08.064
Ui Yeong!

41:08.064 --> 41:10.421
Ui Yeong!

41:10.421 --> 41:11.425
Ui Yeong...

41:28.773 --> 41:29.801
You alright?

41:29.801 --> 41:30.791
I'm fine.

41:30.791 --> 41:35.111
By any chance, did a woman
come by here, about yea tall?

41:35.111 --> 41:36.072
Haven't seen anybody.

41:36.072 --> 41:37.151
Alright, thanks.

41:37.151 --> 41:38.711
Wait.

41:38.711 --> 41:40.692
Who could you possibly be chasing at this hour?

41:40.692 --> 41:42.494
The buses stopped running,

41:42.494 --> 41:44.512
and nothing but critters out here after dark.

41:44.512 --> 41:46.411
- Critters?
- That's right.

41:46.411 --> 41:49.152
Sir, any chance I could use this bike?

41:49.152 --> 41:51.352
I'll just loop around the area
and have it back to you.

41:51.352 --> 41:52.832
You're riding in this storm?

41:52.832 --> 41:54.591
Yes.

41:55.576 --> 41:56.737
Alright, go ahead.

41:56.737 --> 41:58.436
I appreciate it.

41:58.436 --> 42:02.021
- My place is just down over there...
- Yes, thank you so much.

42:05.643 --> 42:07.188
Ui Yeong!

42:07.188 --> 42:09.320
Ui Yeong!

42:14.291 --> 42:16.406
Ui Yeong!

42:16.406 --> 42:18.580
Ui Yeong!

43:03.350 --> 43:05.210
Ui Yeong.

43:07.792 --> 43:09.464
What?

43:24.933 --> 43:26.856
You alright?

43:27.667 --> 43:30.105
I'm okay, but...

43:30.105 --> 43:31.999
You came

43:31.999 --> 43:34.864
all the way through that downpour?

43:36.236 --> 43:38.535
You're completely drenched.

43:48.062 --> 43:50.839
Who are you really?

43:53.291 --> 43:54.796
Excuse me?

43:54.796 --> 43:57.542
How do you

43:57.542 --> 44:00.348
want me to remember you?

44:02.189 --> 44:07.355
We never could get our timing right.
It was always one step off.

44:11.750 --> 44:14.737
Everything you saw...

44:15.500 --> 44:18.449
I can't pretend that wasn't me.

44:21.542 --> 44:23.739
The only thing I know how to do now is

44:23.739 --> 44:26.742
lay it all out on the table.

44:26.742 --> 44:28.333
But

44:28.333 --> 44:31.546
there's more to me than that.

44:32.403 --> 44:36.175
I want you to see the rest.

44:38.458 --> 44:40.550
Give me

44:40.550 --> 44:43.516
a little time.

45:32.685 --> 45:35.166
Tae Seop,

45:35.166 --> 45:38.988
thank you for coming to find me.

45:40.583 --> 45:43.667
I'll show you I was worth it.

45:43.667 --> 45:45.102
Oh, stop,

45:45.102 --> 45:48.581
you sound like some politician
in a press conference.

45:49.542 --> 45:51.667
Besides...

45:51.667 --> 45:54.420
it wasn't all that terrible.

45:59.667 --> 46:03.554
Well, at least the rain stopped.

46:24.064 --> 46:25.464
How did we end up here again?

46:25.464 --> 46:26.724
I know I checked the map.

46:26.724 --> 46:28.244
Look, let's just get inside first.

46:28.244 --> 46:30.407
We're asking for trouble out here.

46:30.407 --> 46:31.958
Wait a second.

46:31.958 --> 46:34.794
Are you religious at all?

46:35.999 --> 46:40.250
If it helps, I'll start believing today.

46:40.250 --> 46:42.093
Amen.

47:00.912 --> 47:04.512
Dear Heavenly Father, sir,

47:04.512 --> 47:08.745
was this all part of your plan?

47:14.083 --> 47:17.992
We just need a roof for tonight.

47:17.992 --> 47:20.835
We won't make a peep, I promise.

47:20.835 --> 47:22.515
Amen.

47:23.250 --> 47:25.136
Ui Yeong.

47:32.671 --> 47:34.562
Thank you.

47:46.733 --> 47:48.110
I'm not even religious.

47:48.110 --> 47:52.492
I won't get struck down for sneaking in, right?

47:54.411 --> 47:56.626
Probably not.

47:57.327 --> 48:01.418
Still, we should slip out at first light
before people start coming in.

48:01.418 --> 48:03.240
Okay.

48:06.934 --> 48:08.407
Are you cold?

48:08.407 --> 48:09.627
No.

48:09.627 --> 48:12.554
It is much warmer than I was out there.

48:12.554 --> 48:15.227
It must be all that hair.

48:15.227 --> 48:17.416
It still looks completely soaked.

48:17.416 --> 48:18.974
Hey,

48:18.974 --> 48:21.859
face the other way for a moment?

48:22.772 --> 48:24.567
It'll dry on its own.

48:24.567 --> 48:25.981
That'll take forever.

48:25.981 --> 48:27.657
One second.

49:05.264 --> 49:06.834
I'm sorry.

49:06.834 --> 49:08.583
No, it's just...

49:08.583 --> 49:10.741
your hands are so warm.

49:56.416 --> 49:58.915
Should I really be doing this?

50:10.127 --> 50:11.670
If it's a sin,

50:11.670 --> 50:15.886
I'll pay for it someday.

50:46.580 --> 50:48.611
You're on bell duty later, right?

50:48.611 --> 50:49.671
Yeah.

50:49.671 --> 50:51.875
When's your turn?

50:51.875 --> 50:53.506
I go after you.

50:53.506 --> 50:55.304
Got it.

50:58.958 --> 51:01.394
Go bring Father over.

51:07.792 --> 51:10.023
They're definitely not here for the service.

51:10.023 --> 51:12.947
Look. They came here to sleep.

51:19.199 --> 51:22.248
She just opened her eyes.

51:26.166 --> 51:29.000
I'm so sorry.

51:29.000 --> 51:30.874
Tae Seop, wake up.

51:37.756 --> 51:41.600
You're the priest here?

51:42.667 --> 51:44.221
Hello.

51:44.221 --> 51:47.119
You actually came!

51:47.119 --> 51:48.428
Welcome.

51:48.428 --> 51:51.694
You know our priest?

52:05.333 --> 52:06.579
He's good-looking.

52:06.579 --> 52:07.828
Maybe I should've just left.

52:07.828 --> 52:09.834
Excuse me.

52:09.834 --> 52:13.276
Guests of the church are also guests of God.

52:13.276 --> 52:15.961
I cannot send you off hungry.

52:15.961 --> 52:17.762
Thank you.

52:25.291 --> 52:27.250
This is quite excellent.

52:27.250 --> 52:30.475
Nuns collected strawberries
from the hills and made jam.

52:30.475 --> 52:35.356
I roasted the beans slowly on a cast-iron lid.

52:35.356 --> 52:38.818
Oh, no wonder.
The coffee is incredibly rich and smooth.

52:38.818 --> 52:39.859
That hits the spot, doesn't it?

52:39.859 --> 52:40.698
Yes.

52:40.698 --> 52:44.330
If you enjoy it, consider attending church.

52:46.542 --> 52:50.017
Last night, I gained some trust.

52:50.017 --> 52:51.358
Did you sleep well?

52:51.358 --> 52:53.697
Using wooden chairs might be
uncomfortable for the back.

52:53.697 --> 52:54.916
No, everything was fine.

52:54.916 --> 52:57.088
We would've been in real trouble
if it weren't for this place.

52:57.088 --> 52:58.976
Thank you very much.

52:58.976 --> 53:01.792
The doors are always open here.

53:01.792 --> 53:03.592
But...

53:03.592 --> 53:05.196
What are you two, exactly?

53:05.196 --> 53:08.416
This calm one appears to take good care of you.

53:08.416 --> 53:10.636
Are you the boyfriend?

53:10.636 --> 53:13.196
Oh no, it's not like that.

53:13.196 --> 53:15.676
Just an acquaintance.

53:15.676 --> 53:17.488
Acquaintance?

53:26.667 --> 53:30.200
Not even friends or coworkers...

53:30.200 --> 53:33.663
I mean, technically,
"acquaintances" is correct.

53:33.663 --> 53:35.729
But we did kiss.

53:35.729 --> 53:37.800
And there was a witness.

53:42.958 --> 53:45.186
Eun Ho and Sua stayed overnight
at a place downtown

53:45.186 --> 53:46.888
and just checked out.

53:46.888 --> 53:51.043
You could ride back with us too.

53:51.043 --> 53:52.082
Oh, no, I'm fine.

53:52.082 --> 53:54.775
I'll just take the train.

53:55.375 --> 53:58.082
There would be too much to explain,

53:58.082 --> 54:00.649
like how we met

54:00.649 --> 54:03.314
and where we stayed.

54:03.314 --> 54:06.328
Oh, right, that's true.

54:25.838 --> 54:27.999
Well...

54:27.999 --> 54:29.894
yesterday...

54:35.392 --> 54:36.416
Yeah?

54:36.416 --> 54:38.319
Yesterday...

54:39.208 --> 54:40.929
Well...

54:43.625 --> 54:47.369
You can return the clothes
I lent you next time.

54:51.375 --> 54:53.000
Sure.

54:53.952 --> 54:57.625
I'll make sure to have them dry-cleaned

54:57.625 --> 55:00.049
and give them back to you.

55:40.392 --> 55:42.549
Number 26...

55:43.375 --> 55:45.302
Yeah, here it is.

56:53.748 --> 56:56.250
What are you doing here?

56:56.250 --> 56:58.291
It's my first time riding without a ticket.

56:58.291 --> 57:01.670
If they catch me,
think I'd owe like, ten times the price?

57:14.958 --> 57:18.088
The rain's being so wishy-washy.

57:18.088 --> 57:21.642
But I bet it'll clear up pretty soon.

57:21.642 --> 57:23.181
What about Uncle?

57:23.181 --> 57:25.740
Looks like he tracked her down.

57:25.740 --> 57:28.083
They managed to find each other this time.

57:28.083 --> 57:30.181
Wait, weren't they fighting?

57:30.181 --> 57:33.583
A fight can turn into a thing, you know.

57:33.583 --> 57:36.121
I have a feeling they'll work it out.

57:52.875 --> 57:55.641
A long time ago, churches would

57:56.384 --> 58:01.230
take in runaways
and people wanted by the government.

58:10.125 --> 58:12.241
Ui Yeong?

59:05.875 --> 59:08.081
You'll have to purchase
the ticket for one adult.

59:08.081 --> 59:09.715
Okay.

59:50.291 --> 59:51.708
Oh, it's cold.

59:51.708 --> 59:54.104
[We handle everything for pop-ups,
from space design to day-to-day ops]

59:54.104 --> 59:57.221
[Styling and exhibition spaces
that match your brand's vibe perfectly]

01:00:05.313 --> 01:00:07.734
Where did you go?
There's mud all over the front door.

01:00:07.734 --> 01:00:11.602
Oh, that... Just let me hang this up real quick
and I'll take care of it.

01:00:11.602 --> 01:00:14.188
And when you stay out overnight,
giving a heads-up beforehand

01:00:14.188 --> 01:00:16.334
is just basic courtesy
to the person you live with.

01:00:16.334 --> 01:00:17.734
It's a scary world out there.

01:00:17.734 --> 01:00:19.013
Oh, I'm sorry.

01:00:19.013 --> 01:00:21.487
I had to rush to Chuncheon out of nowhere

01:00:21.487 --> 01:00:22.659
and my phone went dead.

01:00:22.659 --> 01:00:24.834
I left the office in such a hurry

01:00:24.834 --> 01:00:26.733
that I forgot my charger.

01:00:26.733 --> 01:00:28.460
I'm sorry.

01:00:29.266 --> 01:00:31.171
What's that hoodie?

01:00:31.857 --> 01:00:32.874
This one?

01:00:32.874 --> 01:00:35.797
What about it? It's oversized.

01:00:35.797 --> 01:00:39.930
You don't know everyone's wearing
stuff like this now?

01:00:45.792 --> 01:00:48.914
I met with them and tried my best
to convince them,

01:00:48.914 --> 01:00:50.098
but it didn't work out.

01:00:50.098 --> 01:00:51.698
Did you actually try?

01:00:51.698 --> 01:00:53.683
I don't think that's something
you should say to someone

01:00:53.683 --> 01:00:55.258
who went all the way to Chuncheon
and put in the work.

01:00:55.258 --> 01:00:57.337
You're... right.

01:00:57.337 --> 01:00:59.654
It looks like HOME and us need some time

01:00:59.654 --> 01:01:01.494
to repair the relationship.

01:01:01.494 --> 01:01:04.693
For now, I'll focus on finding a new vendor.

01:01:04.693 --> 01:01:07.745
Everyone will need to work overtime
until we confirm a new vendor.

01:01:07.745 --> 01:01:09.490
Got it.

01:01:11.791 --> 01:01:13.964
Seriously, this is so stressful.

01:01:14.791 --> 01:01:15.893
Sorry.

01:01:15.893 --> 01:01:18.093
It's fine.

01:01:20.208 --> 01:01:22.819
Sae Byeok, it's okay.

01:01:22.819 --> 01:01:25.708
I made a list of new vendors last night.

01:01:25.708 --> 01:01:27.011
I'll send it to you.

01:01:27.011 --> 01:01:28.564
Please check for any plagiarism issues.

01:01:28.564 --> 01:01:29.300
Oh, okay.

01:01:29.300 --> 01:01:31.800
Hyun Min, let's split up
and reach out to the vendors.

01:01:31.800 --> 01:01:33.420
First, let's see
if they can work with our schedule.

01:01:33.420 --> 01:01:35.940
Sure, send me the list
and I'll start calling them from the top.

01:01:35.940 --> 01:01:37.404
Sounds good.

01:01:39.208 --> 01:01:41.879
I love this! Isn't it great?

01:01:41.879 --> 01:01:43.694
I picked it up secondhand
to read over the weekend.

01:01:43.694 --> 01:01:45.160
I heard it's a masterpiece.

01:01:45.160 --> 01:01:47.799
It is. Once you start,
you really can't put it down.

01:01:47.799 --> 01:01:50.458
But you're still on volume one?

01:01:50.458 --> 01:01:52.625
Something else caught my interest,

01:01:52.625 --> 01:01:54.416
so I haven't started it yet.

01:01:54.416 --> 01:01:57.049
What's that?

01:01:57.708 --> 01:02:00.427
[Song Tae Seop]

01:02:04.719 --> 01:02:06.053
Hello?

01:02:06.053 --> 01:02:08.083
It's me.

01:02:08.083 --> 01:02:08.829
Oh, hi.

01:02:08.829 --> 01:02:10.954
What brings you to call at this hour?

01:02:10.954 --> 01:02:12.254
Can I see you now?

01:02:12.254 --> 01:02:14.517
I have something important to tell you.

01:02:14.517 --> 01:02:16.060
I'll come by your office.

01:02:16.060 --> 01:02:18.320
Oh, sure.

01:02:43.938 --> 01:02:46.723
What's so important?

01:02:57.018 --> 01:02:58.561
[I'm here]

01:02:58.561 --> 01:03:01.238
[Take your time]

01:03:04.901 --> 01:03:06.939
Oh, Ui Yeong! You're here.

01:03:06.939 --> 01:03:08.166
Yeah, hi! How have you been?

01:03:08.166 --> 01:03:10.419
- We got a new part-timer, did you know?
- Oh, really?

01:03:10.419 --> 01:03:11.782
I've been training him.

01:03:11.782 --> 01:03:13.266
I see.

01:03:13.266 --> 01:03:14.127
What would you like?

01:03:14.127 --> 01:03:15.827
I'll have a hot latte.

01:03:15.827 --> 01:03:17.247
One hot latte.

01:03:17.247 --> 01:03:19.878
So the last part-timer quit?

01:03:19.878 --> 01:03:22.041
Oh, that one was so unreliable.

01:03:22.041 --> 01:03:23.083
I see.

01:03:23.083 --> 01:03:25.107
I think I picked a good one this time.

01:03:25.107 --> 01:03:27.260
Oh, nice.

01:03:27.260 --> 01:03:29.506
Here he comes.

01:03:29.506 --> 01:03:31.636
She is one of our regulars at the cafe.

01:03:31.636 --> 01:03:33.812
She works at the hotel up there.

01:03:35.557 --> 01:03:37.202
Shin Ji Su.

01:03:37.202 --> 01:03:37.958
What?

01:03:37.958 --> 01:03:38.935
Hi.

01:03:38.935 --> 01:03:40.446
Do you two know each other?

01:03:40.446 --> 01:03:42.409
A little.

01:03:42.409 --> 01:03:43.549
What the...

01:03:43.549 --> 01:03:46.491
What are you doing here now?

01:03:47.166 --> 01:03:48.952
Well...

01:04:21.603 --> 01:04:24.735
I really like him.

01:04:28.495 --> 01:04:30.118
Here you go.

01:04:32.071 --> 01:04:34.911
So how did you end up working here?

01:04:34.911 --> 01:04:37.275
The theater season ended,

01:04:37.275 --> 01:04:40.235
and I got fired from the restaurant
for walking out.

01:04:40.235 --> 01:04:41.556
I still need to eat, so here I am.

01:04:41.556 --> 01:04:44.458
Oh, the play you invited me to last time,

01:04:44.458 --> 01:04:46.736
something urgent came up
and I couldn't make it.

01:04:46.736 --> 01:04:47.495
Sorry.

01:04:47.495 --> 01:04:48.422
Yeah.

01:04:48.422 --> 01:04:51.318
I kept wondering if you'd show up,
even if it was late,

01:04:51.318 --> 01:04:53.012
but you never did.

01:04:53.012 --> 01:04:55.977
Oh, you were waiting?

01:04:56.958 --> 01:04:58.533
I'm just kidding.

01:04:58.533 --> 01:05:01.750
You can't really see the audience
from the stage anyway.

01:05:01.750 --> 01:05:04.873
Acting's my job, so I'll keep doing shows.

01:05:04.873 --> 01:05:05.813
Come next time.

01:05:05.813 --> 01:05:07.034
I'll get you a ticket again.

01:05:07.034 --> 01:05:08.214
Okay, sure.

01:05:08.214 --> 01:05:09.866
Thanks.

01:05:10.906 --> 01:05:11.914
Then buy me a meal.

01:05:11.914 --> 01:05:13.914
One for being sorry, one for being grateful.

01:05:13.914 --> 01:05:16.164
That's two meals.

01:05:17.908 --> 01:05:19.166
Hey,

01:05:19.166 --> 01:05:22.733
but weren't you the one
who owed me an apology first?

01:05:22.733 --> 01:05:24.373
Yeah.

01:05:24.373 --> 01:05:27.250
But you're not taking that back.

01:05:27.250 --> 01:05:30.550
You always find a way
to get a free meal from me.

01:05:30.550 --> 01:05:31.906
How about tomorrow evening?

01:05:31.906 --> 01:05:34.375
I'm working the closing shift tonight.

01:05:34.375 --> 01:05:35.542
Tomorrow...

01:05:35.542 --> 01:05:37.234
Ui Yeong.

01:05:37.958 --> 01:05:40.397
Tae Seop. You're here?

01:05:44.519 --> 01:05:45.787
He can't tell who it is, right?

01:05:45.787 --> 01:05:48.864
We meet again, cousin.

01:05:51.999 --> 01:05:54.996
Why does this feel so familiar?

01:05:54.996 --> 01:05:58.665
Are we just supposed
to walk out that door together now?

01:05:59.667 --> 01:06:01.918
That's not going to happen.

01:06:14.375 --> 01:06:16.625
Yesterday.

01:06:16.625 --> 01:06:18.496
Yesterday?

01:06:18.496 --> 01:06:20.729
We kissed.

01:06:21.472 --> 01:06:22.519
What?

01:06:22.519 --> 01:06:24.667
I was so jittery about seeing you again

01:06:24.667 --> 01:06:27.027
that sleep completely escaped me.

01:06:29.583 --> 01:06:31.531
Did you manage to get any rest?

01:06:53.671 --> 01:06:56.841
[Our timing kept missing]

01:06:56.841 --> 01:06:59.927
[You look like a baked sweet potato]

01:06:59.927 --> 01:07:03.035
[You're still on my mind]

01:07:06.642 --> 01:07:10.362
[The left hand just backs you up]

01:07:13.607 --> 01:07:16.621
[If that's a sin, I'll make up for it one day]

01:07:23.958 --> 01:07:25.710
You want to...

01:07:26.412 --> 01:07:27.896
do what together?

01:07:27.896 --> 01:07:29.583
Ki...

01:07:29.583 --> 01:07:33.089
I should have just finished what I started.

01:07:33.089 --> 01:07:35.416
So are you two dating?

01:07:35.416 --> 01:07:37.677
You're not twenty.
You're giving away your heart over one kiss?

01:07:37.677 --> 01:07:40.456
I really like you, Seung Jun.

01:07:41.177 --> 01:07:43.016
Calm down and use your words.

01:07:43.016 --> 01:07:44.583
We came up with ideas today.

01:07:44.583 --> 01:07:46.390
After work...

01:07:46.390 --> 01:07:48.200
It feels so refreshing.

01:07:48.200 --> 01:07:51.265
You're right there within reach,

01:07:51.265 --> 01:07:55.407
but I can't quite hold on to you,
and it's driving me crazy.

01:07:56.208 --> 01:07:59.244
Did I really sleep with him?
